{"id": "pv_corr_up", "family": "volume_price", "key": "volume_on_up_days", "direction": 1, "zh": "涨时放量、跌时缩量（量价同步）的币，后面表现好", "en": "Coins whose volume rises with price and falls with it, so that price and volume agree, do better afterwards.", "source": "base: flow_price_coherence", "reference": "(Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_corr(Factor('quote_volume').ln(), window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "train"}
{"id": "pv_corr_down", "family": "volume_price", "key": "volume_on_up_days", "direction": -1, "zh": "量价同步的币被追捧过度，后面表现差", "en": "Coins whose price and volume move together are over-chased and do worse afterwards.", "source": "mirror", "reference": "-1 * (Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).ts_corr(Factor('quote_volume').ln(), window=20, min_periods=16)", "split": "train"}
{"id": "surge_no_rise_down", "family": "volume_price", "key": "volume", "direction": -1, "zh": "放量却不涨，说明有人在出货，后面表现差", "en": "Heavy volume with little price movement shows someone is selling into it, so the coin does worse afterwards.", "source": "generic", "reference": "-1 * Factor('quote_volume').ts_mean(window=5, min_periods=4).safe_div(Factor('quote_volume').ts_mean(window=60, min_periods=48)).safe_div((Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('close').lag(periods=1)) - 1).Abs().ts_mean(window=5, min_periods=4))", "also": ["price"], "split": "train"}
{"id": "close_above_vwap_up", "family": "close_vwap", "key": "return", "direction": 1, "zh": "收盘价高于当天成交均价的币，买方占优，后面表现好", "en": "Coins closing above the day's average traded price show buyers in control and do better afterwards.", "source": "base: close_vwap", "reference": "(Factor('close').safe_div(Factor('quote_volume').safe_div(Factor('volume'))) - 1).ts_mean(window=5, min_periods=4)", "split": "train"}
